# Our own temporal upscale after a stop (graphics plan 1г, reports/render-features/2026-11-05-upscale/step-1g-1-taau.md):
# the market at noon as in upscale-walk.bench, but the hero goes by the forward key and the key is let go, so he
# stops on the same cobbles. Stills: standing (`stand`), in full stride as the key is let go (`stop-0`) and 0.1,
# 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2 and 4 s later (the hero stands from about 0.5 s): how soon the picture of a stop is as sharp as
# one that stood. Lockstep, so a run at 100 % is the truth for the others:
#   uv run --with numpy --with pillow python -I reports/render-features/2026-11-05-upscale/stills.py walk <100 % dir> <dir> ...
# Lothar is frozen: his greeting would hold the hero in a dialog.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui on
view full
cam lift off
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
freeze PAL_203_LOTHAR
watch player
walkmode walk
face wp NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
cam look 120
cam follow 380 170 160
wait 10000
shot stand
press forward
wait 4000
release forward
shot stop-0
wait 100
shot stop-1
wait 150
shot stop-2
wait 250
shot stop-3
wait 500
shot stop-4
wait 1000
shot stop-5
wait 2000
shot stop-6
wait 500
